#lang EN
# MyPuppyD — map names and meanings, English (UTF-8, no BOM). Sits next to english.lang and english.dtc.
# Loaded together with english.lang (same "#lang"); entries merge, a later one wins.
#
# MAPCAT_<CODE>=name     map categories, name tails (MAPCAT_TAIL_*), folders (MAPCAT_FOLDER_*),
#                        preview labels (MAPCAT_UI_*). Codes (left side) never change.
# MAPNAM_<original>=meaning
#                        translation of the manufacturer's ORIGINAL map name (damos description or code).
#                        The key is normalised on load (case, spaces/underscores, umlauts, "_16x16" suffix).
#                        The original stays in the map's "Notes" field.

