MAPNAM_Idle speed setpoint according to the engine coolant temperature and atmospheric pressure=Idle speed setpoint vs coolant temperature and atmospheric pressure
MAPNAM_Indicated engine torque at reference conditions=Indicated engine torque at reference conditions
MAPNAM_Interpolated calibration table to detect an inconsistency on accelerator pedal tracks=Accelerator pedal track inconsistency detection
MAPNAM_Inverse accelerator pedal map - conventional mode=Inverse accelerator pedal map — conventional mode
MAPNAM_Kennfeld für Massstrom bei hoher Beladung=Purge mass flow at high canister loading
